  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37878712",
      "title": "Creating a Prompting Template",
      "sourceHash": "5f36d5e77e2466e001c314ad28faa93c894dfafc619a1b63e08ad7bfe77b98df",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.95,
          "en": "Instead of writing random prompts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.95,
          "end": 7.59,
          "en": "I want to guide you through a more structured way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.59,
          "end": 9.99,
          "en": "to create your images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.99,
          "end": 12.03,
          "en": "The idea behind all the prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.03,
          "end": 13.89,
          "en": "we will use in the next lectures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.89,
          "end": 15.69,
          "en": "is to define the basics,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.69,
          "end": 19.44,
          "en": "so what should be displayed on the image in general,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.44,
          "end": 21.63,
          "en": "and then we'll control the details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.63,
          "end": 24.243,
          "en": "of the output that should be generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.08,
          "end": 26.28,
          "en": "To be able to do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.28,
          "end": 29.61,
          "en": "in a structured and easy-to-replicate way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.61,
          "end": 34.173,
          "en": "we'll focus onto five key areas to generate amazing output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.25,
          "end": 37.05,
          "en": "It is important to know, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.05,
          "end": 40.53,
          "en": "that Midjourney does not understand grammar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.53,
          "end": 44.46,
          "en": "sentence structure, or words like humans.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.46,
          "end": 46.92,
          "en": "It's all about the word choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.92,
          "end": 49.77,
          "en": "So the words you include in your prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.77,
          "end": 53.373,
          "en": "and how precise, how specific these words are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.21,
          "end": 57,
          "en": "So the idea behind this prompting template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57,
          "end": 61.17,
          "en": "is that you ensure that you include all the important words,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.17,
          "end": 65.34,
          "en": "all the important areas that should describe your image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.34,
          "end": 69.03,
          "en": "You don't have to follow such a prompting template though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.03,
          "end": 70.74,
          "en": "Based on our experience, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.74,
          "end": 74.94,
          "en": "it's easier to create images according to your preferences",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.94,
          "end": 77.85,
          "en": "when following along a certain structure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.85,
          "end": 79.593,
          "en": "a certain prompting template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.46000000000001,
          "end": 83.78999999999999,
          "en": "So the goal is to write prompts in a more structured way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 85.71000000000001,
          "en": "in a way that we can replicate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.71000000000001,
          "end": 88.473,
          "en": "for other images that we want to generate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.88,
          "end": 93.42,
          "en": "We will now explore the five key areas we defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.42,
          "end": 98.31,
          "en": "step by step in a logical order in practical examples.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.31,
          "end": 100.14,
          "en": "So the first area we'll have a look at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.14,
          "end": 103.08,
          "en": "is the medium or the art style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.08,
          "end": 106.68,
          "en": "So, basically, how the image should be generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.68,
          "end": 108.33,
          "en": "Should it be a photo?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.33,
          "end": 109.92,
          "en": "Should it be an illustration?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.92,
          "end": 111.3,
          "en": "Should it be a sketch?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.3,
          "end": 113.03999999999999,
          "en": "Should it be a 3D animation?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.03999999999999,
          "end": 114.36,
          "en": "And so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 118.533,
          "en": "So what medium should be used to create this image?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.97,
          "end": 122.94,
          "en": "The second core area will be the subject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.94,
          "end": 127.23,
          "en": "The subject describes the core content of the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.23,
          "end": 128.64,
          "en": "In our first example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.64,
          "end": 131.583,
          "en": "the elephant was the core subject, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.45,
          "end": 133.83,
          "en": "Now, in the first example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.83,
          "end": 138.21,
          "en": "we'll use the following descriptions for these two areas.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.21,
          "end": 140.64,
          "en": "Medium will be a photo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.64,
          "end": 141.96,
          "en": "and a photo is something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.96,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "you can always use in Midjourney 5.1",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 150.12,
          "en": "whenever you want to have a realistic photo of something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.12,
          "end": 153,
          "en": "And the subject will simply be a pirate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153,
          "end": 155.52,
          "en": "So a photo of a pirate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.52,
          "end": 157.14,
          "en": "And once again, keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.14,
          "end": 161.22,
          "en": "that Midjourney doesn't understand any grammar, any commas,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.22,
          "end": 165.24,
          "en": "and also not these categories, these areas we define.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.24,
          "end": 167.37,
          "en": "This should just be a guidance for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.37,
          "end": 169.68,
          "en": "to create prompts in a more logical,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.68,
          "end": 171.9,
          "en": "in a more structured way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.9,
          "end": 176.49,
          "en": "So back in Midjourney, we'll now add a photo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.49,
          "end": 178.44,
          "en": "as said, Midjourney 5.1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.44,
          "end": 181.713,
          "en": "this is equal to a realistic image of something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.54,
          "end": 185.97,
          "en": "of a pirate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.97,
          "end": 188.43,
          "en": "One thing about the way I write the prompt now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.43,
          "end": 191.28,
          "en": "I could also add something like photo of pirate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.28,
          "end": 192.96,
          "en": "to keep it very short.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 192.96,
          "end": 195.18,
          "en": "Personally, I'm a fan of a mix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.18,
          "end": 198.78,
          "en": "So I want to keep things as descriptive as possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.78,
          "end": 201.09,
          "en": "in certain parts of the prompt at least.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 201.09,
          "end": 204.09,
          "en": "For other areas of the prompt, which we'll explore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 204.09,
          "end": 207.03,
          "en": "we'll keep it shorter with keywords only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 207.03,
          "end": 209.82,
          "en": "There is no definite right or wrong though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.82,
          "end": 213.3,
          "en": "So there are different ways that lead to great images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.3,
          "end": 216.42000000000002,
          "en": "This is just the way we found out to work for ourselves",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.42000000000002,
          "end": 217.65,
          "en": "to work quite well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 217.65,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "Therefore, we'll follow this approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 222.063,
          "en": "So a photo of a pirate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 223.05,
          "end": 224.613,
          "en": "Now, if we run this prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 227.55,
          "end": 229.47,
          "en": "this obviously doesn't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.47,
          "end": 230.97,
          "en": "This sometimes happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.97,
          "end": 234.03,
          "en": "What we do then typically to kind of fix this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 234.03,
          "end": 238.41,
          "en": "is simply adding the same prompt again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.41,
          "end": 241.35,
          "en": "Then both prompts should be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.35,
