          "en": "within the next minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 242.58,
          "end": 245.34,
          "en": "So there seems to be a little bug here in Midjourney",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 245.34,
          "end": 246.573,
          "en": "that we sometimes see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 249,
          "end": 250.32,
          "en": "So we got a result here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 250.32,
          "end": 254.05,
          "en": "Let's view these in full quality",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 255.9,
          "end": 259.83,
          "en": "and I think this looks pretty impressive actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 259.83,
          "end": 262.62,
          "en": "Midjourney 5.1 tends to be a bit",
